        <p source="#source-7360-7423"><seg source="#source-7360-7366">明治</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-7366-7397" corresp="#source-7368-7397"><seg source="#source-7366-7368">39</seg></hi>年１月『馬醉木』</p>
